SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE and the original written material in this
repository (documentation, result write-ups, pre-registrations, and figures
generated by the scripts herein).

It does NOT cover, and this repository does NOT redistribute:

  * Auslan-Daily (Shen et al.) and MM-WLAuslan (Shen et al.) dataset content --
    video, pose files or annotation files as released, and extracted features.
    Obtain these from their authors under their own terms; see ATTRIBUTION.md.
  * Published papers, or figures reproduced from them. Figures borrowed for the
    accompanying thesis are used there under academic fair dealing and are
    excluded from this repository.
  * Trained model checkpoints, which are derived from the datasets above.

Tables under results/checks/ hold extracts of those datasets' annotations and
the distributed keypoints of one clip. ATTRIBUTION.md lists them. This licence
does not cover them: they remain under the terms of the dataset each comes from.
